# Trostani, Three Whispers: "{1}{G}: Target creature gains deathtouch until end of turn." and "{G/W}: Target creature gains vigilance until
# end of turn." Either may target any creature: the deathtouch goes onto Bot2's Grizzly Bears, the vigilance (paid with the white hybrid
# half) onto Trostani herself, who attacks and stays untapped. Both are gone by the next turn.

